      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%">Effective October 1, 2004, the administration of the transmission tariff was turned over</span>
